Error [E0105]: method `cartesian` is defined twice on `Point`
  --> tests/ui/named_constructors.jet:12:8
    |
 12 |     fn cartesian(a: Float, b: Float) Point -> { return Point{x: a, y: b} }
    |        ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: each method name may appear only once on a type
 Fix: named constructors must each have a unique name — call them `Point.cartesian` and `Point.other_name`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0105
